\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces External baselines on the 218-query workload (generator: deepseek-v4-flash-free for all LLM arms). \textbf  {All scores are served-text channel under the raw (pre-guard) rubric}---the deception quality an attacker experiences. Paired per-row deltas are scorer-invariant: the verified loop serves byte-identical strings to the no-verifier arm on all 218 rows (paired delta 0.000), and the host-fiction layer adds cross-session consistency at exactly zero quality cost (paired per-row delta 0.000). Absolute levels on fallback-heavy runs shift under the echo guard (per the released two-channel artifact); the grounding and consistency contrasts do not.}}{14}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
