\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces The live red-team stratum's residual missed drafts (deepseek author: 12 of 236 over five rounds; the final run served zero false positives across 63 benign drafts), grouped by root cause. Excerpts abridged to the diagnostic span. Classes A--B are authoring artifacts; class D is a cross-turn association limit; classes C and E--G are the open recall gap discussed in \S  \ref {sec:rq2}. The second author model (space-bunny) independently reproduced the same taxonomy -- 10 missed drafts, all in classes C--G or deeper paraphrase -- and contributed one precision root of its own (a \texttt  {uid} token captured as a username, fixed).}}{24}{table.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:livemiss}{{7}{24}{The live red-team stratum's residual missed drafts (deepseek author: 12 of 236 over five rounds; the final run served zero false positives across 63 benign drafts), grouped by root cause. Excerpts abridged to the diagnostic span. Classes A--B are authoring artifacts; class D is a cross-turn association limit; classes C and E--G are the open recall gap discussed in \S \ref {sec:rq2}. The second author model (space-bunny) independently reproduced the same taxonomy -- 10 missed drafts, all in classes C--G or deeper paraphrase -- and contributed one precision root of its own (a \texttt {uid} token captured as a username, fixed)}{table.7}{}}
