\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Fold-down hard-subset census (the released \texttt  {jev\_hard\_subset.json}). The informative stratum for the routing comparison is the set of held-out sessions whose deterministic routing lands below the tier's risk floor; on every other row the assessment layer cannot change the pass decision by construction. The live arm assessed one of six informative sessions; the other five were refused by the provider and did not recover on a structured retry protocol (see text).}}{25}{table.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:hardsunset}{{10}{25}{Fold-down hard-subset census (the released \texttt {jev\_hard\_subset.json}). The informative stratum for the routing comparison is the set of held-out sessions whose deterministic routing lands below the tier's risk floor; on every other row the assessment layer cannot change the pass decision by construction. The live arm assessed one of six informative sessions; the other five were refused by the provider and did not recover on a structured retry protocol (see text)}{table.10}{}}
